{"diagnosis": "Loopback send 0xa5 never arrived so recv_buf_valid never asserted, causing TRAP: uart timeout, no byte received. ser_tx at picosoc/simpleuart.v:107 stuck idle (1) instead of start+data+stop. Root cause at picosoc/simpleuart.v:123 where send_dummy stays 1 in the dummy-fill branch, re-arming 15 idle bits forever and starving the reg_dat_we path at picosoc/simpleuart.v:125.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -119,5 +119,5 @@
 			if (send_dummy && !send_bitcnt) begin
 				send_pattern <= ~0;
 				send_bitcnt <= 15;
 				send_divcnt <= 0;
-				send_dummy <= 1;
+				send_dummy <= 0;
 			end else", "expected": "tohost: PASS with loopback byte 0xa5 received, no uart timeout"}

